.TH rayscan-db 1  "db " 
.SH NAME
rayscan\-db \- Manage the local NVD CVE advisory database
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdb\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage the local NVD CVE advisory database
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
rayscan\-db\-update(1)
Download, verify, and index the latest NVD CVE feeds
.TP
rayscan\-db\-status(1)
Show local advisory database status and coverage
.TP
rayscan\-db\-intel(1)
Download and index the full CISA KEV catalog and current EPSS scores
.TP
rayscan\-db\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
